  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Online Form 2026-27</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-07-27T16:08:23+05:30\">July 27, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">4:08 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://scholarship.up.gov.in/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Social Welfare Department of Uttar Pradesh</a>,</strong> has released the <strong>notification</strong> for the <strong>UP Scholarship 2026-27</strong> for students of <strong>Class 9\u201310 (Pre-Matric)</strong>, <strong>Class 11\u201312 (Post-Matric)</strong>, and <strong>Post-Matric Other Than Intermediate.</strong> The online application process will be open from <strong>22 July 2026 to 21 September 2026. </strong>Interested candidates must check the <strong>eligibility criteria, age limit</strong>, and read the <strong>full notification</strong> before applying. <strong>Eligible students</strong> can submit their applications online within the given dates.<br/>\n</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whatsapp {\n            background-color: #25D366;\n        }\n        .whatsapp:hover {\n            background-color: #1EBE57;\n        }\n        .telegram {\n            background-color: #0088cc;\n        }\n        .telegram:hover {\n            background-color: #0078b8;\n        }\n        .icon {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n    </style></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> Telegram </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Online Form 2026-27</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Scheme 2025-26 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-scholarship-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li>Online Apply Start Date :<strong> 22 July 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Online Apply Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>21 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li>Last Date For Form Complete :\u00a0<strong>21 September 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Send Scholarship in Bank Account Date : <strong>January 2027</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">No Application Fee For Any Candidates</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Online Form 2026-27 : Age Limits As On Official Website Rules.</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Not Specified Check Official Website.</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n<div class